<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_976_2959.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruentlig</unclear> guotwillig dienst, unnd was wir ehren
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guots</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermuegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sigen</unclear> üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jederzit</unclear> zuovor
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuersichtigen</unclear> ersamen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wijssen</unclear>, besonder lieben und guoten
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruendt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uwer</unclear> schriftliche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">widerantwurtt</unclear> uff unnser
<lb n="5"/>an üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethonnes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrijben</unclear>, von wegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wijloundt</unclear>
<lb n="6"/>unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hindersäßin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Junckfraw</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Madlena Koblerin</persName>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">saelgen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verlaßenschafft</unclear>, haben wir empfangen, und
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dieselbigenn</unclear> unnsern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitratsfruenden</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Hannsen von
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wattßheimb</unclear></persName> als <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verordneten</unclear> vogt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnsers</unclear> rathß-
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruendts</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Niclauß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Boellen</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eelicher</unclear> kinden. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear>
<lb n="11"/><persName resp="#ner">Hannß Jergen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Koblers</unclear></persName> als ir <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Junckfraw</unclear> Koblerin</persName>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">saelgen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">instituierter</unclear> erben fuergehalten. deren
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sij</unclear> sich beschwaert und nit versehen. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> daruff
<lb n="14"/>an unns witter begert, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sij</unclear> in die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbschafft</unclear>, nach
<lb n="15"/>unnser statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bruch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> recht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inzesetzen</unclear>, damit
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Junckfraw</unclear> Koblerin <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ussgerichte</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>testament <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">exequieren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegendt</unclear>, Also haben wir
<lb n="18"/>zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soelchem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerumb</unclear> ain tag. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> namblich
<lb n="19"/>uff <date resp="#ner">sampstag den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">drijzehenden</unclear> tag diß monats
<lb n="20"/>decembris</date> angesetzt. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">demselbigen</unclear> wellendt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>ir den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uwern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkünden</unclear>, damit ob <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermainten</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obgehördt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> Koblerin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">saelgen</unclear> testament <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ewas</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inred</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>zehaben, das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soelches</unclear> uff gemelten tag vor unns
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inpringen</unclear>, wellendt wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darinen</unclear> anhoeren.
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> inen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebürliche</unclear> recht widerfaren lassen,
<lb n="26"/>wo aber die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uwern</unclear> soelchen tag abermals nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besuochen</unclear>,
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear> wir den unnsern uff ir begeren. mit gebür-
<lb n="28"/>licher <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">antwurtt</unclear> begegnen, unnd inen die gebür
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">warzuo</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befuogt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestatten</unclear> soellen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woltten</unclear> wir
<lb n="30"/>üch uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obgehört</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uwer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrijven</unclear> unnd uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsern</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anhalten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbürlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mainung</unclear> nit verhalten,
<lb n="32"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sind</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jederzit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbürliche</unclear> und guotwillige
<lb n="33"/>dienst <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zueerwijssen</unclear> genaigt. unnd willig. Datum,
<lb n="34"/><origDate when="1572" cert="medium" resp="#ner">den ersten tag decembris <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">a°</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">x</unclear>. 72</origDate> ,.
<lb n="35"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Verwaltter</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hauptmanschafft</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> burgermaister und rath der
<lb n="37"/>statt Costanntz</orgName> ,.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_976_2960.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_976_2961.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_976_2962.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="38"/>Den fürsichtigen ersamen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿsen</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">burgermaister und rath zuo Sanctt
<lb n="40"/>Gallen</orgName>, unnsern besonndern lieben
<lb n="41"/>unnd guetten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünnden</unclear>.
</p>
